          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5cee-5283-c95d-c323">Once per turn, this unit may perform one of the following actions:

**Armour Bearer** - 
At the start of any phase during your turn, if this unit is not within engagement range of an enemy unit, restore 1 lost Wound to the bearer&apos;s unit.


**Arms Bearer** - 
The bearer&apos;s unit may reroll 1 hit roll and 1 wound roll per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
